#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:1891
msgid "For a selectable 7/30/90-day period (UTC calendar days, clamped to the retention window with an explanatory notice when clamped): summary cards, an accessible daily page-view chart (single-Tab-stop keyboard navigation, touch/mouse tooltips, visible axes, data-table fallback) beside a device-share doughnut, summary charts of top pages, clicked elements, channels, goal completions and lead outcomes, and collapsible sections for Content, Engagement, Acquisition, Devices, Conversions, Goals, Lead outcomes, and Recent Activity. Every chart is drawn from the same result as the table it links to, and prints its values beside its marks. <strong>Export CSV</strong> and <strong>Export JSON</strong> download the period's reports with raw values, and a <strong>Print / Save as PDF</strong> button produces a print-optimized report. Empty states and per-section database-error notices are explicit — a failed query is never rendered as a silent zero."
