#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2078
msgid "Converted into business."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2079
msgid "A real lead that did not convert."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2080
msgid "Never a lead at all."
