#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2344
msgid "An <strong>analytics test</strong> covers the last 7 days, carries <code>\"test\": true</code>, is never retried, and does not advance the endpoint's normal delivery marker — so testing an endpoint never creates a gap in its scheduled reporting."
