#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2463
msgid "Subject tokens are a fixed allowlist, substituted literally — there is no expression language and no PHP evaluation: <code>{site_name}</code>, <code>{form_name}</code>, <code>{provider}</code>, <code>{channel}</code>, <code>{submission_id}</code>, <code>{form_id}</code>, <code>{campaign}</code>, <code>{date}</code>. Anything else stays literal text, and CR/LF and NUL are stripped <em>after</em> substitution, so a form named <code>Contact\\r\\nBcc: …</code> cannot inject a mail header."
