#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2536
msgid "Submission fields — id, label, value"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2538
msgid "<strong>Two shapes are accepted, and both are fully supported.</strong> The richer descriptor list is preferred; the historical map is not deprecated."
