#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2553
msgid "The human-readable label — what a person reads in the Submissions panel, a CSV export, or a notification email. Sanitized the same way, and <strong>falls back to <code>id</code></strong> when missing, blank, or not a scalar."
