#: src/Admin/Pages/AboutPage.php:2847
msgid "<strong>Public.</strong> The tracker's ingestion endpoint: idempotent batches, per-IP and site-wide rate limits, same-host URL validation, Origin/Referer protection, bot filtering, and DNT/GPC enforcement. It answers <code>202</code> with <code>{\"stored\": n}</code>, <code>400</code>/<code>403</code>/<code>413</code>/<code>429</code> (with <code>Retry-After</code>) on rejection, and <code>503</code> when storage failed — in which case the tracker keeps the batch and retries."
